+- AC3 -> "AC3: cuts at the end of the last word that fits", "AC3: never leaves a trailing separator", "AC3: a limit equal to the first word keeps just that word", "AC3: a limit ending one short of a word end drops that word", "AC2-AC4: results match the criteria for many inputs and limits"
+- AC4 -> "AC4: a first word longer than maxLength is hard-cut", "AC4: a single long word is hard-cut to maxLength", "AC2-AC4: results match the criteria for many inputs and limits"
+- AC5 -> "AC5: result is bounded, has no edge separators, and is a prefix of the full slug"
+- AC6 -> "AC6: maxLength <value> throws a TypeError naming maxLength" for 0, -1, 1.5, NaN, Infinity, '10', null
+- AC7 -> "AC7: options <value> throws a TypeError naming options" for null, 42, 'maxLength'
